<title>GERMANY: Germany's GBH to issue shares at 28.50 dmk in IPO.</title>
<headline>Germany's GBH to issue shares at 28.50 dmk in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German real estate company Grundstuecks - und Baugesellschaft AG (GBH) will issue five-mark shares at 28.50 marks per share in an initial public offering, lead-manager Baden-Wuerttembergische Bank AG said on Monday.</p>
<p>The shares will be listed on October 11.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
